# Spec S-045: plugins/obs-outputs/rtmp-stream.c and net-if.c are #included into the runner (their static
# functions are driven directly). Everything outward is faked inside the runner: libobs objects, librtmp,
# the FLV muxer, the kernel interface list (getifaddrs), ioctl(FIONREAD), threads (pthread_create is a
# fake; the send-thread body is run synchronously) and the clock.
# Not linked (and therefore not tested): the real librtmp transport (S-031), the real FLV muxer (S-021),
# the Windows socket thread (rtmp-windows.c), real threads and sockets.
test/conformance/gen/rtmpstream_runner.c
-ljansson
-DSSL_CTX=void
-DENABLE_HEVC
-Wno-unused-parameter
